while doing gimmicks on top of the train.

247
00:18:13.167 --> 00:18:14.542
Are you aware?

248
00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:16.042
I'm out of words, uncle.

249
00:18:16.792 --> 00:18:17.958
The afternoon local train

250
00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:20.083
