-Get the stuff out.

738
00:56:41.958 --> 00:56:43.042
-Drop your weapons.
-Get the stuff out.

739
00:56:43.125 --> 00:56:44.000
-Stop the van.
-Go. Go.

740
00:56:44.083 --> 00:56:45.417
Everybody stop that van.

741
