-Shit!
-Cover me. Cover me.

744
00:57:05.625 --> 00:57:07.000
Go. Get it up. Get it up.

745
00:57:07.125 --> 00:57:08.333
Go, go, go.

746
00:57:08.417 --> 00:57:10.667
Don't move.
Don't move.

747
