790
00:59:31.083 --> 00:59:32.250
What?

791
00:59:36.042 --> 00:59:37.625
Oh, my God! No, no, no.

792
00:59:50.833 --> 00:59:52.333
Hey, Patricia madam.
Siddharth.

793
00:59:52.833 --> 00:59:53.833
Yes, Siddharth.

794
00:59:53.917 --> 00:59:56.125
